Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: comctl32: Scale fixed pixel sizes of the common controls to the DPI.
 Up-down control width, date and time picker button and check box, header
 divider hit area, pager buttons, rebar gripper and chevron, tab item
 padding, tooltip margins, balloon geometry and the offset below the
 cursor, track bar channel and ticks, and the minimum tree view indent
 were fixed pixel values. Scale them to the DPI of the control's window;
 96 DPI is unchanged.
Last-Modified: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:28:12 +0300

